WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.534
-Performing
"Tropic Morning News"

00:00:02.534 --> 00:00:04.133
from their upcoming album,

00:00:04.133 --> 00:00:06.234
"First Two Pages
Of Frankenstein,"

00:00:06.234 --> 00:00:09.901
give it up for The National!

00:00:09.901 --> 00:00:11.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:11.701 --> 00:00:18.434
♪♪

00:00:18.434 --> 00:00:25.167
♪♪

00:00:25.167 --> 00:00:31.901
♪♪

00:00:31.901 --> 00:00:34.300
-♪ I wasn't starting yet ♪

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:38.400
♪ I didn't even think
you were listening ♪

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:40.634
♪ I wasn't ready at all ♪

00:00:40.634 --> 00:00:44.901
♪ To say anything
about anything interesting ♪

00:00:44.901 --> 00:00:46.701
♪ It's a thing you have ♪

00:00:46.701 --> 00:00:50.300
♪ You just don't know
that you do it ♪

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:53.400
♪ You wait around
in a conversation ♪

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:58.067
♪ While I get in and
start stumbling through it ♪

00:00:58.067 --> 00:01:00.334
♪ I was so distracted then ♪

00:01:00.334 --> 00:01:03.000
♪ I didn't have it straight
in my head ♪

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:07.968
♪ I didn't have my face on yet
or the role or the feel ♪

00:01:07.968 --> 00:01:11.100
♪ Of where I was going
with it all ♪

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:14.501
♪ I was suffering more
than I let on ♪

00:01:14.501 --> 00:01:17.801
♪ The tropic morning news
was on ♪

00:01:17.801 --> 00:01:21.100
♪ There's nothing stopping me
now ♪

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:24.801
♪ From saying
all the painful parts out loud ♪

00:01:24.801 --> 00:01:26.267
♪ Got to my feet ♪

00:01:26.267 --> 00:01:29.634
♪ Feeling that
I'd let you down ♪

00:01:29.634 --> 00:01:32.534
♪ I wanted to say it slow
and perfect ♪

00:01:32.534 --> 00:01:37.467
♪ But it all somehow got
switched around ♪

00:01:37.467 --> 00:01:39.834
♪ Something went off
on its own ♪

00:01:39.834 --> 00:01:44.133
♪ My dumb, automatic chit-chat ♪

00:01:44.133 --> 00:01:47.400
♪ It's not what I meant to say
at all ♪

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:50.267
♪ There's no way you can
attach me to that ♪

00:01:50.267 --> 00:01:52.167
♪ Got up to seize the day ♪

00:01:52.167 --> 00:01:55.701
♪ With my head in my hands
feeling strange ♪

00:01:55.701 --> 00:01:58.367
♪ When all my thinking
got mangled ♪

00:01:58.367 --> 00:02:03.834
♪ And I caught myself talking
myself off the ceiling ♪

00:02:03.834 --> 00:02:07.234
♪ I was suffering more
than I let on ♪

00:02:07.234 --> 00:02:10.367
♪ The tropic morning news
was on ♪

00:02:10.367 --> 00:02:13.667
♪ There's nothing stopping me
now ♪

00:02:13.667 --> 00:02:17.067
♪ From saying all
the painful parts out loud ♪

00:02:17.067 --> 00:02:22.000
♪ Oh, where are all
the moments we'd have? ♪

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:25.167
♪ Oh, where's the brain
we shared? ♪

00:02:25.167 --> 00:02:30.100
♪ Something somehow has you
rapidly improving ♪

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:35.133
♪ Oh, what happened to
the wavelength we were on? ♪

00:02:35.133 --> 00:02:38.200
♪ Oh, where's
the gravity gone? ♪

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:43.200
♪ Something somehow has you
rapidly improving ♪

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:46.200
