00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:51.300
♪♪

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:56.367
♪♪

00:02:56.367 --> 00:02:59.734
♪ You found the ache
in my argument ♪

00:02:59.734 --> 00:03:03.100
♪ You couldn't wait
to get out of it ♪

00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:06.400
♪ You found the slush
in my sentiment ♪

00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:09.601
